"Notification":"Notification","Le sol est trop humide : ouvre Vivariom pour l'aider.":"The soil is too wet: open Vivariom to help.","🐝 Un essaim se forme !":"🐝 A swarm is forming!","Viens voir les abeilles se rassembler en grappe.":"Come and watch the bees gather in a cluster.","Le brumisateur ne peut plus brumiser.":"The mister can't mist any more.","Ton vivarium a tenu : viens voir tes étoiles.":"Your vivarium held out: come and see your stars.","😢 Une espèce a disparu":"😢 A species has disappeared","quand le jeu est ouvert en arrière-plan":"when the game is open in the background","pas disponibles sur ce navigateur":"not available in this browser","🔔 Notifications":"🔔 Notifications","🔕 Notifications refusées par le navigateur : autorise-les dans ses réglages.":"🔕 Notifications blocked by the browser: allow them in its settings.",
